<p>&#8230;.but which, as I've noted before, make perfect sense for the Chaos Insurgency to have, because obviously they would have taken the most useful and well understood items with them when they split off, leaving the Foundation to contain the rest. Good job on helping to reinforce that idea, I like it :P</p>
<p>Also: when I first saw the title of this entry i narrowed my eyes and thought &quot;if the author of this isn't Troy then it is SO not going in my headcanon.&quot; Pleased with the end results though.</p>

